OL,3,CEngland star Jude Bellingham spotted
OL,4,Cat Alton Towers with girlfriend
OL,6,FEngland star Jude Bellingham has been
OL,7,Fspotted enjoying a day at Alton Towers
OL,8,Fwith his girlfriend.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old from Stourbridge
OL,11,Fattracted a crowd on Tuesday, as he
OL,12,Fand girlfriend Ashlyn Castro were at
OL,13,Fthe Staffordshire theme park.
OL,15,FHe had to be surrounded by security as
OL,16,Ffans followed him around the park.
OL,18,FBellingham has been taking time off
OL,19,Fafter leading England to the semi-
OL,20,Ffinals of the World Cup.
