OL,3,CEngland star Jude Bellingham spotted
OL,4,Cat Alton Towers with girlfriend
OL,6,FThe Three Lions took home a third-
OL,7,Fplace medal after beating France in a
OL,8,F6-4 thriller.
OL,10,FBellingham returned to the UK last
OL,11,Fweek and was at St Andrews to watch
OL,12,FBirmingham City defeat Barcelona last
OL,13,FFriday.
